  "_doc": "Lucento's regional prices on Google Play (docs/monetization/REGIONAL_PRICING.md). Each Play region belongs to one tier; a tier's base price is converted by Play (pricing:convertRegionPrices: today's exchange rate, local tax, local price endings). Tier 3 is the Philippine price, so its regions get exactly what Play derives from the peso prices; PH itself is pinned. Prices are decimal strings, never floating point. Edit this file, then run `node tools/play-pricing/pricing.mjs plan`.",
